  bl.2 hospital pen|Base.Pen|Marla made her keep one that wrote clearly; the name on it has nearly rubbed off.
  bl.3 creased cigarette packet|Base.CigarettePack|A reason to step outside; she resents needing a reason for a moment without questions.
  bl.4 brass lighter|Base.Lighter|Irene's old lighter, borrowed often enough that neither calls it a loan now.
  bl.5 blank jar label||Tucked into a pocket after the last canning day; Kim dislikes being unable to name what she carries.
  bl.6 faded cardigan||Kept at the hospital for cold rooms, now worn over scrubs that no longer mean she is on duty.
  rl.1 Connie Webb|adult daughter|Eighteen, left home in June; Kim wants to answer for her even while learning to stop.
  rl.2 Irene Hensley|mother|Stayed in Vine Grove when last known; saved the borrowed flood blanket and jars with useless lids.
  rl.3 Marla Deane|coworker|Taught Kim clearer instructions; Kim took her car and drove away from her calling voice.
end

